## Tool Selection Quick Guide

| If you need... | Use... |
|----------------|--------|
| Quick answer about a library | `resolve-library-id` → `query-docs` (Context7) |
| Deep, thorough research | `tavily_research` (pro) after primary docs are found |
| Targeted search with filters | `tavily_search` (advanced) |
| Current official/GitHub docs discovery | `tavily_search` + `tavily_map` + `tavily_extract` |
| Exact library/API usage or code examples | `resolve-library-id` → `query-docs` (Context7), then verify exact contracts with Tavily when needed |
| Official Microsoft docs | `microsoft_docs_search` |
| Multiple perspectives at once | `parallel_search_web` (Jina) |
| Read a specific page | `read_url` (Jina) or `tavily_extract` |
| Explore a doc site | `tavily_crawl` or `tavily_map` |
| Academic papers | `search_arxiv` (Jina) |
| Code samples for MS/Azure | `microsoft_code_sample_search` |
| Live webpage testing | `cursor-ide-browser` tools |
| Find code in workspace | `SemanticSearch` or `Grep` |
